* G1_TOP breaker path, chip level: (g-B) power-up: VDD ramp 1-3 us, IOVDD/VDDA 5-7 us, EN low until 12 us; GATE loaded by 5 nF + 10 Ohm only
* CDL-driven full chip (run_top_cdl.py): blocks/g1_padring/netlist/g1_chip_top_1414.cdl sha256 af5a4dbd0b17013b11d32f31221353a22b2676ea884e3487db3f14d9c5443a36, top g1_chip_top instantiated once
* case gB | block netlists pex (extracted: g1_bgr, g1_gate, g1_sense, g1_t2f, g1_trip) | clock to the RTL ideal | corner ff | -40 degC | pads nodcn | method gear
* g1_bgr <- blocks/g1_bgr/sim/postlayout/g1_bgr586_pex.spice (sha256 01227a3d8d8210d10d2d1ee6933842351140b8825fe29282f0327936a3064ad5)
* g1_gate <- blocks/g1_gate/sim/postlayout/g1_gate_pex.spice (sha256 e91617f5fcf6f5a0dc721a2ba53b507a05cc226d6dbf0bebaa858a1e7d876765; not hash-bound in run_top.py)
* g1_sense <- blocks/g1_sense/sim/postlayout/g1_sense_r100_partialc.spice (sha256 ffb14762659eaf02b6a62e9edea3caa0e143cbc7881378b329d6ab9945a6554b)
* g1_t2f <- blocks/g1_t2f/sim/postlayout/g1_t2f_pex.spice (sha256 441edabc0484c9de1e035d585369f37d460afe32370e73935044693bbfd0c78a)
* g1_trip <- blocks/g1_trip/sim/postlayout/g1_trip_nf4_pex.spice (sha256 ba86b7b2a530abae365d539297909e033b24a54597f9cc75d8dff273c30d401c)
* translated: 40 subckts; devices D dpantenna 7, M sg13_hv_nmos 191, M sg13_hv_pmos 18, M sg13_lv_nmos 8, M sg13_lv_pmos 7, Q npn13G2 1, R ptap1 42, R rppd 29, X 36, ptap1 R from sg13g2_io.spi 42, removed dantenna 8; replaced g1_digital, g1_osc; 4833 filler instances merged
* WARNING deviation --pads nodcn: every dantenna instance of the translated chip removed (IO cells and sg13g2_antennanp; 8 instances); reason: run_top.py PADS_NODCN_WARNING
* not in this deck (differences to run_top.py): the Cw_* wire capacitors (the CDL has none); the d_source RTL stimulus (the RTL reads the EN/SCLK/SDI IOPadIn outputs); fitted GATE/FAULT_N drivers
.param VDDA=3.3 VDD=1.2 IOVDD=3.3 RSH=25m RGND=10m INOM=1 CVREF=1e-08
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib mos_ff
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOShv.lib mos_ff
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerRES.lib res_bcs
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerCAP.lib cap_bcs
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerHBT.lib hbt_bcs
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerDIO.lib dio_tt
.temp -40
.global sub!
Vsub sub! 0 dc 0
.option method=gear itl4=100 reltol=0.001 abstol=1e-10 vntol=1e-6 chgtol=1e-14 rshunt=1e12
.include /work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_bgr/sim/postlayout/g1_bgr586_pex.spice
.include /work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_sense/sim/postlayout/g1_sense_r100_partialc.spice
.include /work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_trip/sim/postlayout/g1_trip_nf4_pex.spice
.include /work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_gate/sim/postlayout/g1_gate_pex.spice
.include /work/designs/g1-guardian/blocks/g1_t2f/sim/postlayout/g1_t2f_pex.spice
* ---- supplies: one 3.3 V board rail feeds VDDA (pin 7) and IOVDD (pin 3), PLAN D14; 1.2 V VDD (pin 1)
V33 rail33 0 pwl(0 0 5e-06 0 7e-06 3.3)
Vma rail33 vdda_s dc 0
Vmi rail33 iovdd_s dc 0
Rsa vdda_s vdda 0.5
Cda vdda 0 1n
Rsi iovdd_s iovdd 0.5
Cdi iovdd 0 1n
V12 vdd_s 0 pwl(0 0 1e-06 0 3e-06 1.2)
Rsd vdd_s vdd 0.5
Cdd vdd 0 1n
* ---- board: load current profile (1 V = 1 A) x switch on the FET gate node, shunt, Kelvin traces, FET gate
Vprof iprof 0 pwl(0 1)
Bload 0 ldi I = v(iprof) * (0.5 + 0.5*tanh((v(gfet) - 1.5)/0.15))
Vim ldi shp dc 0
Rsh shp shn {RSH}
Rgnd shn 0 {RGND}
Rkp shp sense_p 1
Rkn shn sense_n 1
Rg gate gfet 10
Cgate gfet 0 5n
Cfault fault_n 0 20p
Ven en_pad 0 pwl(0 0 1.20221787305e-05 0 1.20230787305e-05 1.485 1.20232787305e-05 1.815 1.20241787305e-05 3.3)
Vsclk sclk_pad 0 pwl(0 0)
Vsdi sdi_pad 0 pwl(0 0)
.model adc adc_bridge(in_low=0.55 in_high=0.65 rise_delay=1e-12 fall_delay=1e-12)
.model adc_clock adc_bridge(in_low=0.6 in_high=0.6 rise_delay=1e-12 fall_delay=1e-12)
.model dac dac_bridge(out_low=0 out_high=1.2 out_undef=0.6 t_rise=0.3n t_fall=0.3n)
.model rtl d_cosim simulation="ivlng" sim_args=["/work/build/g1_top/cosim_e52f10915079baf3da8d63be.vvp"]
* ---- the chip: g1_chip_top_1414.cdl, 22 pins on the board fixture
