meas tran t_vdd06 when v(vdd)=0.6 rise=1
meas tran t_iovdd11 when v(iovdd)=1.1 rise=1
meas tran t_por06 when v(xchip.net)=0.6 rise=1
meas tran t_oscen when v(xchip.i_core_osc_en)=0.6 rise=1
